<title>NEW ZEALAND: Westpac Investment owns 28 pct of CBD.</title>
<headline>Westpac Investment owns 28 pct of CBD.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westpac Investment Management NZ on Thursday declared a 28 percent interest in CBD New Zealand Ltd.</p>
<p>In a notice to the New Zealand Stock Exchange, Westpac Investment said the stake dates back to May 12, the day before CBD listed on the exchange.</p>
<p>CBD last traded at NZ$0.98 per share.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
</text>
